{"id":"n83461-1-9","stage":5,"title":"습성 · 习惯","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83461-1-9-1","ko":"빵이라도 좀 먹고 출근하지?","zh":"先吃点面包再去上班吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빵이라도","meaning":"面包","explanation":"빵：面包；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"빵","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23402","senseId":"1","lemma":"빵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빵이라도","audio":"/audio/5f5b052b27c8b021ec31.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹고","audio":"/audio/b2dca7d94e3e3049878e.mp3"}},{"text":"출근하지?","meaning":"上班","explanation":"출근하다：上班；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"출근하다","audio":"/audio/c9a21c441e737abe8903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62368","senseId":"1","lemma":"출근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출근하지","audio":"/audio/83abadfb6c429b069c79.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"edc73c627b8f32b7","term":"빵","zh":"面包","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3","entryId":"23402","definition":"将面粉揉和并使之发酵后，蒸或烤而成的食物。","pronunciation":["빵"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"c9a21c441e737abe","term":"출근하다","zh":"上班","audio":"/audio/c9a21c441e737abe8903.mp3","entryId":"62368","definition":"去单位工作。","pronunciation":["출근하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f0c5d9a3be61c7df785.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83461-1-9-2","ko":"난 괜찮아. 아침밥을 안 먹는 게 습성이 됐거든.","zh":"我没事的。我已经养成了不吃早餐的习惯。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아.","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아","audio":"/audio/87dea6f32ecb5a9bbac8.mp3"}},{"text":"아침밥을","meaning":"早饭，早餐","explanation":"아침밥：早饭，早餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아침밥","audio":"/audio/1091bb02ab160ef0400b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66915","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침밥을","audio":"/audio/4e1fe552c4f0568e3bfa.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"먹는","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹는","audio":"/audio/8eed52fccdd9cbc6591a.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"습성이","meaning":"习惯","explanation":"습성：习惯；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"습성","audio":"/audio/403e5f7b2c5f15e23526.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83461","senseId":"1","lemma":"습성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"습성이","audio":"/audio/1e8c576dc4080d44d2ab.mp3"}},{"text":"됐거든.","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐거든","audio":"/audio/dbdbf6da2d32aaf32fdb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"1091bb02ab160ef0","term":"아침밥","zh":"早饭，早餐","audio":"/audio/1091bb02ab160ef0400b.mp3","entryId":"66915","definition":"早上吃的饭。","pronunciation":["아침빱"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"403e5f7b2c5f15e2","term":"습성","zh":"习惯","audio":"/audio/403e5f7b2c5f15e23526.mp3","entryId":"83461","definition":"像习气一样习以为常的性质。","pronunciation":["습썽"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7a5e331aec7dec0f7313.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.584,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83461","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.4107,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["先吃点面包再去上班吧？","我没事的。我已经养成了不吃早餐的习惯。","听说昨天凌晨我们小区发生了枪击事件。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["先吃点面包再去上班吧？","我没事的。我已经养成了不吃早餐的习惯。","听说昨天凌晨我们小区发生了枪击事件。"],"answer":1}]}
